MIT. Keeping the name and the story is a courtesy, not a requirement.

## The name

"BOCCONCINI" reads like mozzarella to an English speaker. It is not: it means
small bites. If you fork and republish, please carry STORIA.md along — a
courtesy, not a licence requirement.
